>1)  What the hell is with all these fruits?  I know in rogue the mangos 
>cured blindness, but jeez!  Apples, Bananas, Kiwis, Carrots, Eggs, etc, etc, 
>just can't be figured out easily in this game.  Anyone care to fill me in?  
>

Here is the list of what comestibles (aside from corpses, which can convey
many things) do when you eat them:

 - sprig of wolfsbane: Purify you if you're a were-something.
 - carrot: restore your eyesight (if you're blineded).
 - fortune cookie: give you a rumor.
 - lump of royal jelly: gain strength, HP, possibly increase max HP,
                        and cure injured legs.
 - egg: turns you to stone if it's a cockatrice egg

The rest do nothing except feed you (I always thought apples did something,
but I can't find it in the code).

